|               |                   Projection: catalog_sales.cs_sold_date_sk, catalog_sales.cs_warehouse_sk, catalog_sales.cs_item_sk, catalog_sales.cs_sales_price, catalog_returns.cr_refunded_cash                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
